{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13188","headline":"见诸姬学玉台体 · 皇甫冉","name":"见诸姬学玉台体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"艳唱召燕姬，清弦待卢女。\n由来道姓秦，谁不知家楚。\n传盃见目成，结带明心许。\n宁辞玉辇迎，自堪金屋贮。\n朝朝作行云，襄王迷处所。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}